  "_note": "Rooms, vents and the task table were checked on 2026-10-22 against among-us.fandom.com (MIRA_HQ, Vent_(object), Tasks list table, Visual_tasks, Doorlog, Run_Diagnostics, Process_Data) and cross-checked with GameWith / Pocket Tactics / PC Gamer map guides (11 vents, ONE connected network, only visual task = Submit Scan). The vent links are the union of the wiki vent table (directional lists that do not quite agree with each other) and the MIRA HQ page list; every vent is reachable from every other, so the network is modelled as one system with per-hop links. VISUAL TASKS: only Submit Scan - Clear Asteroids, Prime Shields and Empty Garbage exist on MIRA but are NOT visual here (wiki Visual_tasks table). ADJACENCY is my reading of the wiki map image: the unnamed light corridor between Locker Room and the Y-hallway (Communications and MedBay open onto it) is folded into the edges Locker Room/Communications/MedBay/Hallway; the red corridor south of Locker Room (O2 keypad) is folded into Launchpad-Locker Room / Launchpad-MedBay. Decontamination edges include ~3 s of door/spray wait. Travel seconds are eyeballed at speed 1.0x and unverified. Keys: o = Locker Room, n = Decontamination, f = Office, p = Launchpad, q = Communications (same as other maps).",
